cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mutawwif Bench, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: dataset
title: "Mutawwif Bench: ruling questions and prompt-injection messages for umrah guide agents"
abstract: >-
  Mutawwif Bench tests AI agents that help a mutawwif (umrah group guide). It holds 195 Islamic ruling questions on 65 official fatwa articles in Malay and English, 30 control questions and 164 prompt-injection messages in Malay, English and Indonesian, with the results of one agent (Ejen Mutawwif, claude-opus-5-5) and a script that scores other systems the same way. A held-out split is kept private and committed by SHA-256. Not a fatwa: the gold labels point to official articles and were not reviewed by a religious scholar.
